{"id":"8e21aff80559d65a","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics.md","title":"Rank Semantics under the Fixed-Point Equation","display":"lem-single-letter-trace-semantics — Rank Semantics under the Fixed-Point Equation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics","aliases":["89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-single-letter-trace-semantics — Rank Semantics under the Fixed-Point Equation","depends_on":["[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]","[[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-single-letter-trace-semantics — Rank Semantics under the Fixed-Point Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c9feb1083d7b4dd\" href=\"?note=4c9feb1083d7b4dd\" title=\"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace\">89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8eb27a8b07c2dc2b\" href=\"?note=8eb27a8b07c2dc2b\" title=\"89-lem-finite-rank-successors\">89-lem-finite-rank-successors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仅含字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 模型。</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in W\">\\(v\\in W\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,v\\models p\\leftrightarrow A\">\\(M,v\\models p\\leftrightarrow A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_p\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_p\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A\">\\(t_A\\)</span> 为双递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_F\">\\(\\rho_F\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 的秩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}trace\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nM,w\\models B\\Longleftrightarrow t_A(B,\\rho_F(w))=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}trace\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nM,w\\models B\\Longleftrightarrow t_A(B,\\rho_F(w))=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 109–110；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>先对世界秩归纳，再对以盒为原子的当前布尔构造归纳。每个盒公式的全部后继秩恰覆盖较小自然数，外层归纳给它的真值等于相应积。模态化使当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 值先于当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 确定；模型满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=A\">\\(p=A\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 值也等于递归指定的值。剩下底、否定、合取逐条吻合。全模型方程是实质前提；只在根有未加盒的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=A\">\\(p=A\\)</span> 不足以使用本结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace","status":"resolved","id":"4c9feb1083d7b4dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-finite-rank-successors","status":"resolved","id":"8eb27a8b07c2dc2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-finite-rank-successors]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"M,v\\models p\\leftrightarrow A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_p","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"t_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_F","display":false},{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}trace\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nM,w\\models B\\Longleftrightarrow t_A(B,\\rho_F(w))=1.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p=A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p=A","display":false}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"单字母构造：[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics]] → [[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c9feb1083d7b4dd","8eb27a8b07c2dc2b","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}